#. (itstool) path: plugin/_short
msgid "XDG Activation Protocol"
msgstr "XDG 激活协议"

#. (itstool) path: plugin/_long
msgid ""
"An implementation of the xdg-activation-v1 protocol. This allows the active "
"app to pass the focus to a different view in the same or a different app."
msgstr "xdg-activation-v1 协议的实现。允许活动应用将焦点传递给同一应用或不同应用中的其他窗口。"

#. (itstool) path: option/_short
msgid "Restrict to valid view"
msgstr "限制为有效窗口"

#. (itstool) path: option/_long
msgid ""
"Whether to reject creating activation requests if no source view exists. "
"Without this option, any view can grab to focus at any time."
msgstr "如果不存在源窗口，是否拒绝创建激活请求。未启用此选项时，任何窗口都可以随时抢占焦点。"

#. (itstool) path: option/_short
msgid "Restrict to the most recent activation request"
msgstr "限制为最新激活请求"

#. (itstool) path: option/_long
msgid ""
"Whether to reject activation requests if a newer request has arrived since "
"their creation."
msgstr "如果创建后又有更新的请求到达，是否拒绝该激活请求。"

#. (itstool) path: option/_short
msgid "Timeout for activation (in seconds)"
msgstr "激活超时（秒）"

#. (itstool) path: option/_long
msgid ""
"Focus requests will be ignored if at least this amount of time has elapsed "
"between creating and using it."
msgstr "如果从创建到使用之间的时间达到此值，焦点请求将被忽略。"
